coach "Blitz Happy"
about "Send pressure on every down and dare them to beat it before the rush gets home."

defense:
  when third down and to go over 10 -> call "Cover 1" or "Cover 3"
  when third down -> call "Cover 0 Blitz" or "Cover 0 Blitz" or "Cover 1"
  when they run over 55% -> call "Run Blitz" or "Cover 0 Blitz"
  otherwise -> call "Cover 0 Blitz" or "Run Blitz" or "Cover 1"

lineup:
  DL "Speed Rusher"
  LB "Thumper"
  CB "Shutdown Corner"
  S "Enforcer"
